//   node tools/skin-repair.mjs                 rebuild assets/models/real/{soldier2,operator}.glb in place, print before → after
//   node tools/skin-repair.mjs --verify        write nothing: measure original and file on disk, check every invariant and budget, exit 1 on failure
//   node tools/skin-repair.mjs --report out.md --sheets DIR      the diagnosis + tables as Markdown; CPU-rendered contact sheets (PNG) before / after
