// Measures (--verify / --report): open, non-manifold, degenerate, shells, triangles, bytes · LEAK (rays from the bone axes that meet no triangle) · GAP (cross-shell vertex pairs
// within 5 mm at rest, their distance in the poses) · TORN (edges doubled or halved) · liner poke-through — at rest and in ≥ 12 poses skinned on the CPU from the file's own clips.
// JPEG decoding for the sheets and the liner's texel uses macOS `sips` (or ImageMagick `magick`).
